.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KLDLOAD-DASHBOARD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kldload-dashboard
.Nd open the whole web console as a desktop application window
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Opens the kldload web console \(em its KVM, Kubernetes, ZFS and metrics
views \(em in a browser window with no browser controls, as a desktop
application.
.Xr kldload-win 8
opens a single view instead.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print the header comment and exit 0.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kldload-webui 8 ,
.Xr kldload-win 8
